 or upon death.\nOutline:\nWhat is Estate Planning?\nEstate Planning Proces
 s\nKey ideas\nTools and Resources\nQ&A\nLearning Objectives:\nUnderstand
 ing the what and why of Estate Planning\nTo understand various tools of E
 state Planning\nPowers of Attorney\nWills\nJoint Accounts\nGifting Trust\
 nDefine dying without a will\nDrop-in. No registration required.\nPlease c
 ontact Maryvale at (416) 396-8931\, or visit us in-branch\, if you have a
 ny questions.
LOCATION:Maryvale
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e64836b6c4ac1fedcd8b30
