DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260616T153000
UID:69e16419b6c4ac1fedccea6e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Put your word skills to the test! Join us for some friendly Sc
 rabble in a relaxed\, welcoming space. Whether you are a triple-word-score
  pro or new to the game\, all adults are welcome.\nDrop-in\, no registrati
 on required.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e16419b6c4ac1fedccea6e
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
