DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260805T200000
UID:6963e19a94297d3600a49425@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in for a chat with fellow readers and librarians about ou
 r favourite books on the monthly theme.\nCome find inspiration for your ne
 xt read\, add some books to your 'to be read' list\, and join the conversa
 tion!\nUpcoming themes include:\nFeb 4 - Reading (About) Minds: Mental Hea
 lth Reads\nMarch 4 - Spring Killing: Murder Mysteries & Thrillers\nApril 1
  - April Fooling: Humour\, Comedy\, & Books That Made Us Laugh!\nDon't hes
 itate to call us or visit the first floor red desk if you have any questio
 ns.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 2/3 on the 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6963e19a94297d3600a49425
