BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Saturday Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T150000
UID:69da9e9ae2a2952aed0e29bd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us once a month on Saturday to discuss the selected book 
 of the month. Share your thoughts and enjoy a lively discussion with fello
 w book lovers.\nThe Book Club Title for Saturday May 23 2026 is Dandelion
  by Jamie Chai Yun Liew. Limited copies will be available at the desk star
 ting Saturday April 25 2026.\nThis is a drop-in program. No registration 
 is required.\nPlease visit the branch\, or call us at 416-396-8931 if you 
 have any questions.\nPrint:\nDandelion\nE-Book:\nDandelion\nE-Audiobook:\n
 Dandelion
LOCATION:Maryvale
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69da9e9ae2a2952aed0e29bd
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
